{"id":"n20269-1-13","stage":0,"title":"키 · 身高","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20269-1-13-1","ko":"아이가 많이 컸어요.","zh":"孩子长高了不少。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多。","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"컸어요.","meaning":"长高了","explanation":"크다：长大；与孩子的身高相联系，这里表示长高了。-었어요 是过去或完成的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66584","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컸어요","audio":"/audio/a656330b32a09f0cf42a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"长大、长高","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66584","definition":"身体逐渐长大；这里指身高增加。","pronunciation":["크다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fef22e99ba008327715d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20269-1-13-2","ko":"지난달보다 무려 오 센티미터나 키가 자랐네요.","zh":"和上个月相比，身高居然长了五厘米呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난달보다","meaning":"比上个月","explanation":"지난달：上个月；-보다 用于比较，表示“比上个月”。","readings":[{"term":"지난달","audio":"/audio/4ef0b7b8e3c716651a62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26900","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난달보다","audio":"/audio/499cd2713e2f4b1641f6.mp3"}},{"text":"무려","meaning":"足足、竟然","explanation":"무려：用于数量前，表示数量多得出乎意料，相当于“足足、竟然”。","readings":[{"term":"무려","audio":"/audio/94d68bf0030bd49d3450.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15323","senseId":"1","lemma":"무려","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무려","audio":"/audio/94d68bf0030bd49d3450.mp3"}},{"text":"오","meaning":"五","explanation":"오：五。","readings":[{"term":"오","audio":"/audio/c0ccf82e09f1e8734531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31635","senseId":"1","lemma":"오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오","audio":"/audio/c0ccf82e09f1e8734531.mp3"}},{"text":"센티미터나","meaning":"五厘米之多","explanation":"센티미터：厘米；-나 接在数量后，强调数量超出预期，这里不是表示选择的“或者”。","readings":[{"term":"센티미터","audio":"/audio/12335f87e5be7af07e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65101","senseId":"1","lemma":"센티미터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"센티미터나","audio":"/audio/ef160485f18c03165afb.mp3"}},{"text":"키가","meaning":"身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿","explanation":"키：身高，身长，个子，个儿，个头儿；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"키","audio":"/audio/e37db65fd90db469af33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20269","senseId":"1","lemma":"키","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"키가","audio":"/audio/26f2f72df3c979a9df96.mp3"}},{"text":"자랐네요.","meaning":"长高了","explanation":"자라다：生长；这里指身高增长。-았네요 表示过去或完成，并带有新发现的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"자라다","audio":"/audio/17c36cbe99642c8ec84b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66317","senseId":"1","lemma":"자라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자랐네요","audio":"/audio/2a43f1808044f994046b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4ef0b7b8e3c71665","term":"지난달","zh":"上月，上个月","audio":"/audio/4ef0b7b8e3c716651a62.mp3","entryId":"26900","definition":"本月的前一月。","pronunciation":["지난달"]},{"id":"94d68bf0030bd49d","term":"무려","zh":"足足、竟然","audio":"/a